      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This causes us constant issues at Venice Immersive. We have players with different levels of experience who sometimes get lost, as well as players who need to rejoin after a crash or restart.\n\nIn many cases, we have to abandon the tour or world hop for those players because there is no simple way for them to rejoin the group unless the world builder has implemented a third-party solution.",
